         ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: development for libkysdk-diagnosetest
 A set of interfaces and tools are provided to assist the software
 development of the diagnose and test layer. It includes data collection 
 module.
 Contains development files for libkysdk-diagnosetest.

Package: libkysdk-diagnosetest-doc
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
			${shlibs:Depends}
Description: a list of man page.
 You can use the man manual to query libkysdk diagnosetest 
 layer component information to help users.
 Enable users to quickly understand the corresponding api.

Package: libkysdk-datacollect
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
        ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: libkysdk-datacollect is a module in libkysdk-diagnosetest that,
 used to collect user operation data,for optimize applications function.

